  <DisplayName>k__BackingField: 'Console: Snake Pit'
  <Description>k__BackingField: Classic snake on your own TV. Eat the apples, grow
    longer - and don't bite the walls or yourself.
  <PreviewImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1fae49045ea06ed44802a0dd62634e0f, type: 3}
  <Rules>k__BackingField:
  - Every apple makes you longer and faster
  - You can't turn straight back on yourself
  - Crash and you restart - only your best run counts
  <Objective>k__BackingField: Grow the longest snake.
  <Danger>k__BackingField: Hitting a wall or your own tail ends the run.
  <Scoring>k__BackingField: Apples eaten in your best run; everyone gets the same
    apples.
  <Controls>k__BackingField:
  - WASD|Steer
  - ARROWS|Steer
